{"title":"P11043 - P11043 [蓝桥杯 2024 省 Java B] 分布式队列 - 洛谷","slug":"2026-05-20-P11043-P11043-蓝桥杯-2024-省-Java-B-分布式队列-洛谷","date":"2026-05-19T16:00:00.000Z","updated":"2026-05-20T02:41:21.171Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2026-05-20-P11043-P11043-蓝桥杯-2024-省-Java-B-分布式队列-洛谷.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<p>&lt;博客&gt;</p>\n<h2 id=\"洛谷-P11043-分布式队列-同步机制优化详解\"><a href=\"#洛谷-P11043-分布式队列-同步机制优化详解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"[洛谷 P11043] 分布式队列 + 同步机制优化详解\"></a>[洛谷 P11043] 分布式队列 + 同步机制优化详解</h2><h3 id=\"题目概览\"><a href=\"#题目概览\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题目概览\"></a>题目概览</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>题目来源</strong>: 洛谷 <a href=\"https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P11043\">P11043</a></li>\n<li><strong>题目难度</strong>: ★★☆☆☆</li>\n<li><strong>标签分类</strong>: 算法（数据结构）、同步机制</li>\n<li><strong>核心考点</strong>: 分布式队列的实现、同步机制的应用</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"题意解析\"><a href=\"#题意解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题意解析\"></a>题意解析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>问题描述</strong>: 实现一个分布式队列，支持添加元素、同步队列状态和查询最短队列长度。</li>\n<li><strong>输入格式</strong>: 输入由操作指令组成，指令包括<code>add</code>、<code>sync</code>和<code>query</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>输出格式</strong>: 对<code>query</code>指令，输出最短队列长度。</li>\n<li><strong>样例分析</strong>:<ul>\n<li>输入: <code>add 1\\nadd 2\\nsync 1\\nquery\\n</code></li>\n<li>输出: <code>1</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"算法思路\"><a href=\"#算法思路\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"算法思路\"></a>算法思路</h3><h4 id=\"4-1-问题分析\"><a href=\"#4-1-问题分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.1 问题分析\"></a>4.1 问题分析</h4><ul>\n<li>本题的核心在于实现一个分布式队列，并确保不同节点上的队列状态一致。</li>\n<li>关键观察点包括队列的同步和状态查询。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-2-算法原理\"><a href=\"#4-2-算法原理\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.2 算法原理\"></a>4.2 算法原理</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>朴素思路</strong>: 使用一个全局队列来同步所有节点的状态，每次添加元素或同步时更新全局队列。</li>\n<li><strong>优化路径</strong>: 通过局部队列和同步操作来减少全局操作，提高效率。</li>\n<li><strong>算法选择</strong>: 选择基于局部队列和同步操作的实现方式。</li>\n<li><strong>核心思想</strong>: 使用局部队列存储元素，通过同步操作保持队列状态一致。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-3-代码详解\"><a href=\"#4-3-代码详解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.3 代码详解\"></a>4.3 代码详解</h4><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> sys</span><br><span class=\"line\">N=<span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">input</span>())</span><br><span class=\"line\">nodes=[[] <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(N)]</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">pr</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;=节点状态=&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(N):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;节点<span class=\"subst\">&#123;i&#125;</span>:<span class=\"subst\">&#123;nodes[i]&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;=节点状态=&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">add</span>(<span class=\"params\">element</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    nodes[<span class=\"number\">0</span>].append(element)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">sync</span>(<span class=\"params\">follower_id</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(nodes[follower_id])!=<span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(nodes[<span class=\"number\">0</span>]):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        e=nodes[<span class=\"number\">0</span>][<span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(nodes[follower_id])]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        nodes[follower_id].append(e)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">query</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    min_len=<span class=\"number\">1e9</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>,N):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        min_len=<span class=\"built_in\">min</span>(min_len,<span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(nodes[i]))</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(min_len)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">for</span> line <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> sys.stdin:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    line=line.rstrip(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;\\n&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> line:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">break</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    ops = <span class=\"built_in\">list</span>(line.rstrip(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;\\n&#x27;</span>).split())</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> ops[<span class=\"number\">0</span>]==<span class=\"string\">&quot;add&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        add(<span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(ops[<span class=\"number\">1</span>]))</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">elif</span> ops[<span class=\"number\">0</span>]==<span class=\"string\">&quot;sync&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        sync(<span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(ops[<span class=\"number\">1</span>]))</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">elif</span> ops[<span class=\"number\">0</span>]==<span class=\"string\">&quot;query&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(query())</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"5-1-核心代码段\"><a href=\"#5-1-核心代码段\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.1 核心代码段\"></a>5.1 核心代码段</h4><ul>\n<li><code>add(element)</code>: 添加元素到节点0的队列。</li>\n<li><code>sync(follower_id)</code>: 同步节点0的队列到指定节点。</li>\n<li><code>query()</code>: 查询最短队列长度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"5-2-逐行解析\"><a href=\"#5-2-逐行解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.2 逐行解析\"></a>5.2 逐行解析</h4><ul>\n<li><code>nodes=[[] for _ in range(N)]</code>: 初始化N个空队列。</li>\n<li><code>add(element)</code>: 将元素添加到节点0的队列。</li>\n<li><code>sync(follower_id)</code>: 如果指定节点的队列长度小于节点0的队列长度，则同步元素。</li>\n<li><code>query()</code>: 遍历所有节点，找到最短队列长度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"5-3-优化技巧\"><a href=\"#5-3-优化技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.3 优化技巧\"></a>5.3 优化技巧</h4><ul>\n<li>使用局部队列和同步操作，减少全局操作，提高效率。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"6-复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#6-复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"6. 复杂度分析\"></a>6. 复杂度分析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>: O(N)，其中N为节点数。</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>: O(N)，每个节点存储一个队列。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"7-输入输出示例\"><a href=\"#7-输入输出示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"7. 输入输出示例\"></a>7. 输入输出示例</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>样例输入</strong>: <code>add 1\\nadd 2\\nsync 1\\nquery\\n</code></li>\n<li><strong>样例输出</strong>: <code>1</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"8-常见错误与调试技巧\"><a href=\"#8-常见错误与调试技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"8. 常见错误与调试技巧\"></a>8. 常见错误与调试技巧</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>易错点</strong>: 同步操作可能导致数据不一致。</li>\n<li><strong>调试方法</strong>: 使用打印语句查看队列状态。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"9-总结与扩展\"><a href=\"#9-总结与扩展\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"9. 总结与扩展\"></a>9. 总结与扩展</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>核心收获</strong>: 学会了分布式队列的实现和同步机制的应用。</li>\n<li><strong>举一反三</strong>: 可以将此思路应用于其他分布式系统的同步问题。</li>\n<li><strong>进阶方向</strong>: 研究更高效的同步机制和分布式算法。</li>\n</ul>\n","more":"<p>&lt;博客&gt;</p>\n<h2 id=\"洛谷-P11043-分布式队列-同步机制优化详解\"><a href=\"#洛谷-P11043-分布式队列-同步机制优化详解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"[洛谷 P11043] 分布式队列 + 同步机制优化详解\"></a>[洛谷 P11043] 分布式队列 + 同步机制优化详解</h2><h3 id=\"题目概览\"><a href=\"#题目概览\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题目概览\"></a>题目概览</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>题目来源</strong>: 洛谷 <a href=\"https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P11043\">P11043</a></li>\n<li><strong>题目难度</strong>: ★★☆☆☆</li>\n<li><strong>标签分类</strong>: 算法（数据结构）、同步机制</li>\n<li><strong>核心考点</strong>: 分布式队列的实现、同步机制的应用</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"题意解析\"><a href=\"#题意解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题意解析\"></a>题意解析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>问题描述</strong>: 实现一个分布式队列，支持添加元素、同步队列状态和查询最短队列长度。</li>\n<li><strong>输入格式</strong>: 输入由操作指令组成，指令包括<code>add</code>、<code>sync</code>和<code>query</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>输出格式</strong>: 对<code>query</code>指令，输出最短队列长度。</li>\n<li><strong>样例分析</strong>:<ul>\n<li>输入: <code>add 1\\nadd 2\\nsync 1\\nquery\\n</code></li>\n<li>输出: <code