/span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> sys</span><br><span class=\"line\">N=<span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">input</span>())</span><br><span class=\"line\">nodes=[[] <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(N)]</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">pr</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;=节点状态=&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(N):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;节点<span class=\"subst\">&#123;i&#125;</span>:<span class=\"subst\">&#123;nodes[i]&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;=节点状态=&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">add</span>(<span class=\"params\">element</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    nodes[<span class=\"number\">0</span>].append(element)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">sync</span>(<span class=\"params\">follower_id</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(nodes[follower_id])!=<span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(nodes[<span class=\"number\">0</span>]):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        e=nodes[<span class=\"number\">0</span>][<span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(nodes[follower_id])]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        nodes[follower_id].append(e)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">query</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    min_len=<span class=\"number\">1e9</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>,N):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        min_len=<span class=\"built_in\">min</span>(min_len,<span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(nodes[i]))</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(min_len)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">for</span> line <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> sys.stdin:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    line=line.rstrip(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;\\n&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> line:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">break</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    ops = <span class=\"built_in\">list</span>(line.rstrip(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;\\n&#x27;</span>).split())</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> ops[<span class=\"number\">0</span>]==<span class=\"string\">&quot;add&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        add(<span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(ops[<span class=\"number\">1</span>]))</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">elif</span> ops[<span class=\"number\">0</span>]==<span class=\"string\">&quot;sync&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        sync(<span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(ops[<span class=\"number\">1</span>]))</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">elif</span> ops[<span class=\"number\">0</span>]==<span class=\"string\">&quot;query&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(query())</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"5-1-核心代码段\"><a href=\"#5-1-核心代码段\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.1 核心代码段\"></a>5.1 核心代码段</h4><ul>\n<li><code>add(element)</code>: 添加元素到节点0的队列。</li>\n<li><code>sync(follower_id)</code>: 同步节点0的队列到指定节点。</li>\n<li><code>query()</code>: 查询最短队列长度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"5-2-逐行解析\"><a href=\"#5-2-逐行解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.2 逐行解析\"></a>5.2 逐行解析</h4><ul>\n<li><code>nodes=[[] for _ in range(N)]</code>: 初始化N个空队列。</li>\n<li><code>add(element)</code>: 将元素添加到节点0的队列。</li>\n<li><code>sync(follower_id)</code>: 如果指定节点的队列长度小于节点0的队列长度，则同步元素。</li>\n<li><code>query()</code>: 遍历所有节点，找到最短队列长度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"5-3-优化技巧\"><a href=\"#5-3-优化技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.3 优化技巧\"></a>5.3 优化技巧</h4><ul>\n<li>使用局部队列和同步操作，减少全局操作，提高效率。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"6-复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#6-复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"6. 复杂度分析\"></a>6. 复杂度分析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>: O(N)，其中N为节点数。</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>: O(N)，每个节点存储一个队列。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"7-输入输出示例\"><a href=\"#7-输入输出示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"7. 输入输出示例\"></a>7. 输入输出示例</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>样例输入</strong>: <code>add 1\\nadd 2\\nsync 1\\nquery\\n</code></li>\n<li><strong>样例输出</strong>: <code>1</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"8-常见错误与调试技巧\"><a href=\"#8-常见错误与调试技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"8. 常见错误与调试技巧\"></a>8. 常见错误与调试技巧</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>易错点</strong>: 同步操作可能导致数据不一致。</li>\n<li><strong>调试方法</strong>: 使用打印语句查看队列状态。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"9-总结与扩展\"><a href=\"#9-总结与扩展\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"9. 总结与扩展\"></a>9. 总结与扩展</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>核心收获</strong>: 学会了分布式队列的实现和同步机制的应用。</li>\n<li><strong>举一反三</strong>: 可以将此思路应用于其他分布式系统的同步问题。</li>\n<li><strong>进阶方向</strong>: 研究更高效的同步机制和分布式算法。</li>\n</ul>\n","categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"蓝桥杯","path":"api/tags/蓝桥杯.json"},{"name":"算法题解","path":"api/tags/算法题解.json"},{"name":"P11043","path":"api/tags/P11043.json"}]}